   "before0000000000": {
    "_id": "before0000000000",
    "type": "base",
    "description": "<p>You can target yourself instead of one creature with this ability. Choose one of the following effects, which lasts until the end of the encounter or until you are dying:</p><ul><li><p>Whenever a target makes a power roll, they can roll three dice and choose which two rolls to use.</p></li><li><p>Whenever a target makes a power roll, they must roll three dice and use the lowest two rolls.</p></li></ul><section class=\"secret\"><p><em>Draw Steel: Combat Tools automates part of this. <a href=\"https://github.com/TheGenieOfTheCode/draw-steel-combat-tools/wiki/Enhanced-Abilities\">What it does, and what it leaves to you</a></em></p></section>",
